vendors need to go through the VIRP.During vendor onboarding  incase the vendor does not meet the Opella''s requirements, Risk Acceptance Letter to be signed by the Business", "autoAttestationRule": null, "assessmentTemplateKey": null, "revalidationIntervalMonths": null}, "before": null}', '2026-09-09 08:28:45.407', 'USER'),
